OL,3,GNEWSAIsland post service resumes after
OL,4,Ajetty collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA postal service to an island nature
OL,7,Freserve has resumed after an 18-month
OL,8,Fgap following the reinstatement of a
OL,9,Fcollapsed jetty.
OL,11,FRoyal Mail deliveries to Brownsea
OL,12,FIsland in Poole Harbour, Dorset, came
OL,13,Fto a halt after the seabed beneath the
OL,14,FNational Trust (NT) jetty in Sandbanks
OL,15,Fwashed away in 2024.
OL,17,FWhile rebuilding work got under way,
OL,18,Fthe National Trust set up a PO Box
OL,19,Fservice, with a member of staff
OL,20,Fcollecting mail from the mainland.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
